            </note>
            <note corresp="#d845-f3" n="26" xml:id="d845-f3-content">
                <p>For further correspondence between Ambassador Grew and the Japanese Minister for
                    Foreign Affairs (Toyoda), see <ref target="frus1931-41v01#pg_913">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, Vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, pp. 913</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus1931-41v01#pg_924">924</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
